SUMMARY:Peru: Minimum wage (RMV) rises to S/ 1\,230\, then S/ 1\,300
DESCRIPTION:Effective 1 Oct 2026. Decreto Supremo Nº 015-2026-TR raises th
 e RMV for private-sector workers from S/ 1\,130.00 to S/ 1\,300.00 in two 
 tranches.\n\nSource: https://busquedas.elperuano.pe/dispositivo/EX/2559163
 -1\nDetails: https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/countries/peru.html#pe-rmv\
 n\nFor information only\, not legal or tax advice. Sources last checked 1 
 October 2026.
